[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3683895897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114287#issuecomment-3683895897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114287","id":3683895897,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bk8pZ","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-22T19:42:02Z","updated_at":"2025-12-22T19:42:02Z","body":"Your AnimatedSprite3D has a material assigned to `material_override` property, hence that material overrides the built-in material. It has that specific single-frame texture assigned:\n\n<img width=\"1482\" height=\"979\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64a1b405-f690-4473-a5e7-01d61a638e50\" />\n\nThe AnimatedSprite3D's drawing logic is unaffected, it still determines the source rect (quad mesh UVs) and destination rect (quad mesh vertex positions) according to the current frame:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/scene/3d/sprite_3d.cpp#L1027-L1057\nSo the dest rect/quad position/size changes according to the frame sizes in the assigned SpriteFrames, as usual. But the RenderingServer uses assigned material override and hence uses different texture than the built-in material would.\n\nAFAICT that's not a bug.\n\n---\n\n> What I don't know is if it's a Compatibility Pipeline issue\n\nIt's not an issue with the Compatibility renderer, it behaves the same in Forward+.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3683895897/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3683965552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114287#issuecomment-3683965552","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114287","id":3683965552,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7blNpw","user":{"login":"MelaDogGames","id":82226641,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMjI2NjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82226641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames","html_url":"https://github.com/MelaDogGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-22T20:00:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-22T20:03:42Z","body":"> Your AnimatedSprite3D has a material assigned to `material_override` property, hence that material overrides the built-in material. It has that specific single-frame texture assigned:\n\nAha, I see.  but get this: I literally never assigned a material to it.  Never once did I click the material button on that object via AnimatedSprite3D.  It did so when the class was originally a CPUParticleSystem, because I changed the class from CPUParticleSystem to AnimatedSprite3D.  So instead of resetting the material, it carried over.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3683965552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3683970880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114287#issuecomment-3683970880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114287","id":3683970880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7blO9A","user":{"login":"MelaDogGames","id":82226641,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMjI2NjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82226641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames","html_url":"https://github.com/MelaDogGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-22T20:02:24Z","updated_at":"2025-12-22T20:02:24Z","body":"In any case, this is more of a double-sided oversight.  Maybe the class conversions can be improved in the future to avoid situations like this but for now, I won't consider this a bug anymore.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3683970880/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3683980470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114287#issuecomment-3683980470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114287","id":3683980470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7blRS2","user":{"login":"MelaDogGames","id":82226641,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMjI2NjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82226641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames","html_url":"https://github.com/MelaDogGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MelaDogGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-22T20:05:39Z","upd